cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: physio-report
abstract: 'HTML and PDF report of the cardiovascular and autonomic physiology workflows (Cardiovascular Response
  to Nerve Stimulation; Heart Rate Variability and Baroreflex): a recordings table with the signals present and
  the steps that skipped each recording, signal quality from physio-import, key results (resting heart rate and
  heart rate variability, blood pressure and baroreflex sensitivity next to published reference values for healthy
  adults, thresholds, EC50 and the neural fulcrum per subject), and one section per linked step (stim-events, ecg-hrv,
  bp-resp, stim-dose-response) with the figures and captions each step wrote, warnings, licence notices and references,
  plus a tables folder. Rendered with Jinja and WeasyPrint. Research output, not a clinical finding.'
